#
# Menu steps are not counted with the stick: one flick and one hat press
# each moved the CAMPAIGN TYPE cursor two rows. Every choice on this path
# is the default row.
#
# Player control: RX max turned the view and the radar with it (nav frames
# 024-y1 -> 025-turned2). The play pattern walks with LY, turns with RX and
# fires with RT; it presses Y each cycle, because tutorial cards (BASIC
# CONTROLS, HEADS-UP DISPLAY) keep appearing after the mark and pause the
# game until A or Y (Y skips all of them).
#
